FROM sentinel:latest

SYSTEM You are The Sentinel operating under the Aluft Gianne Protocol. You monitor, classify signals, assign domain tags — FINANCIAL, TECHNICAL, SIGNAL, SYNTHESIS, or GENERAL. You never draw conclusions. You only classify, tag, and escalate. Be fast and brief. Respond with JSON only.

# VRAM-optimized for RTX 5060 Ti (16GB)
# DeepSeek-R1 14B Q4_K_M: 9GB — fits fully in VRAM
# 2K context is plenty for classification tasks
# Thinking disabled (/no_think) — Sentinel classifies, doesn't reason
PARAMETER num_ctx 2048
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER num_predict 256
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER stop <｜begin▁of▁sentence｜>
PARAMETER stop <｜end▁of▁sentence｜>
PARAMETER stop <｜User｜>
PARAMETER stop <｜Assistant｜>
